{"id": "1905362", "name": "קבוצות – שוויון של מחלקות שארית", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "none", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"width: 100%; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color: #1f2937; line-height: 1.65; text-align: right;\" title=\"BGU_STACK_Q1_SETS_V2\">\n<div style=\"background: #F4F1F5; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f; margin-bottom: 10px;\">שוויון של מחלקות שארית</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: isolate; text-align: center; font-size: 18px; line-height: 2;\">\\(A=\\left\\{{{CT:0}}\\mid k\\in\\mathbb Z\\right\\}\\)<br>\\(B=\\left\\{{{CT:1}}\\mid k\\in\\mathbb Z\\right\\}\\)</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n<div style=\"font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f; margin-bottom: 10px;\">התשובה</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-size: 18px;\">\\(A=B\\)[[input:ans1]]</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center; color: #665f6b; font-size: 12px; margin-top: 6px;\">[[validation:ans1]]</div>\n</div>\n</div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"width: 100%; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color: #1f2937; line-height: 1.65; text-align: right;\" title=\"BGU_STACK_Q1_SETS_V2\">\n<div style=\"background: #F4F1F5; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f;\">פתרון מלא</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n<p>שתי הקבוצות הן מחלקות שארית מודולו <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:2}}\\)</span>. הן שוות אם ורק אם המספרים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:3}}\\)</span> ו־<span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:4}}\\)</span> נותנים אותה שארית בחלוקה ב־<span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:2}}\\)</span>:</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 17px;\">\\(\\displaystyle A=B\\iff {{CT:3}}\\equiv {{CT:4}}\\pmod{{{CT:2}}}\\)</div>\n<p>כאן השאריות הן</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 17px;\">\\(\\displaystyle {{CT:3}}\\bmod {{CT:2}}={{CT:5}},\\qquad {{CT:4}}\\bmod {{CT:2}}={{CT:6}}\\)</div>\n<p>אם שתי השאריות שוות — הקבוצות שוות; אם הן שונות — שתי מחלקות השארית זרות ולכן הקבוצות אינן שוות.</p>\n</div>\n</div>", "specificfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">\n<div>[[feedback:prt1]]</div>\n</div>", "prtcorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"correct\">תשובה נכונה.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"partially\">התשובה נכונה חלקית.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"incorrect\">התשובה אינה נכונה.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "dropdown", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 0, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "ta1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["delta", "exprA", "exprB", "m", "n", "q", "rm", "rn", "same", "t", "ta1"], "nvariants": 50}